(7609547, 1230696, 50695, '<td valign="top">my first impulse was ugh, fireworks, but I like how you include the people and that strange structure on the right. This is not a big corporate fireworks show, this is a homemade event, and you captured some of that spirit.</td>', 'my first impulse was ugh, fireworks, but I like how you include the people and that strange structure on the right. This is not a big corporate fireworks show, this is a homemade event, and you captured some of that spirit.', '2019-01-21 10:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609548, 1230895, 50695, '<td valign="top">ah yes the satisfying pared down geometry and even the clouds seem to be participating, but no ... that puff of smoke, that brief assertion of life disrupting perfection.</td>', 'ah yes the satisfying pared down geometry and even the clouds seem to be participating, but no ... that puff of smoke, that brief assertion of life disrupting perfection.', '2019-01-21 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609549, 1230800, 50695, '<td valign="top">you picked a good person to duplicate. I think her army will save us.</td>', 'you picked a good person to duplicate. I think her army will save us.', '2019-01-21 10:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609550, 1230345, 50695, '<td valign="top">two things I like about this. the painterly processing, which might just be a filter but it works particularly well for his hand. the second is the close crop which still has all the important details: the hand on the reins, the rope, horse''s mane</td>', 'two things I like about this. the painterly processing, which might just be a filter but it works particularly well for his hand. the second is the close crop which still has all the important details: the hand on the reins, the rope, horse''s mane', '2019-01-21 10:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609551, 1230363, 50695, '<td valign="top">art can be a bit sentimental at times, dwelling in a glimmer when there''s work to be done. sometimes art dares to share space with that other, older, force called love. It can easily go wrong, but such art is fearless. and, besides, failing in the name of love is the best way to fail.<br/> <br/>this art succeeds in saying that this dog is loved.</td>', 'art can be a bit sentimental at times, dwelling in a glimmer when there''s work to be done. sometimes art dares to share space with that other, older, force called love. It can easily go wrong, but such art is fearless. and, besides, failing in the name of love is the best way to fail. this art succeeds in saying that this dog is loved.', '2019-01-21 10:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609553, 1231005, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think I see some extended trickery going on, the clouds ascending from the grass, and I appreciate that.</td>', 'I think I see some extended trickery going on, the clouds ascending from the grass, and I appreciate that.', '2019-01-21 11:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609554, 1231026, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice colors and well composed.</td>', 'nice colors and well composed.', '2019-01-21 11:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609555, 1230976, 50695, '<td valign="top">rice and beans</td>', 'rice and beans', '2019-01-21 11:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609556, 1231003, 50695, '<td valign="top">i''m suspicious of your blur but I do like the diagonal composition, it even spirals a bit, with loads of juicy darkness. and of course there''s that mona lisa smile....</td>', 'i''m suspicious of your blur but I do like the diagonal composition, it even spirals a bit, with loads of juicy darkness. and of course there''s that mona lisa smile....', '2019-01-21 11:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609557, 1230964, 50695, '<td valign="top">this evokes so many things for me, the way the past gets further away, clouded in dust and hidden behind reflections, and how our own eyes get worse at seeing just as our memories get harder to see. the past becomes exotic even to us who lived it, hiding coyly behind its fan</td>', 'this evokes so many things for me, the way the past gets further away, clouded in dust and hidden behind reflections, and how our own eyes get worse at seeing just as our memories get harder to see. the past becomes exotic even to us who lived it, hiding coyly behind its fan', '2019-01-21 11:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
