(7609565, 1230548, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m tired of skyscraper reflections but you did well with this super high contrast treatment and the crosshatching fire escapes. an engaging abstract.</td>', 'I''m tired of skyscraper reflections but you did well with this super high contrast treatment and the crosshatching fire escapes. an engaging abstract.', '2019-01-21 11:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609566, 1231027, 42733, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this!</td>', 'I love everything about this!', '2019-01-21 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609567, 1230363, 42733, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! In my top 3. Great light. An excellent portrait.</td>', 'Gorgeous! In my top 3. Great light. An excellent portrait.', '2019-01-21 11:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609568, 1230890, 42733, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nicely executed.</td>', 'Great idea, nicely executed.', '2019-01-21 11:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609570, 1230994, 50695, '<td valign="top">this gets at the complicated relationship between life and art. The saying is that Art Imitates Life, and sure you can see that here. You are imitating a deer in the forest. But you''re not attempting to fool us. You''re actually trying to create a magical sort of world. Art Creates An Imitation Of A Nonexistent Life. And you do it by assembling other people''s art, an imitation of a nonexistent deer and imitations of nonexistent trees. You use perspective to create an illusion of depth, but your background only conveys snowfall, it doesn''t convey ground and sky, so the objects float in a sentimental nothingness. This is the Magic of which you speak: no meaning, no themes, no insights into the human condition, just the Magic for its own sake, just an assertion of the power of human imagination.</td>', 'this gets at the complicated relationship between life and art. The saying is that Art Imitates Life, and sure you can see that here. You are imitating a deer in the forest. But you''re not attempting to fool us. You''re actually trying to create a magical sort of world. Art Creates An Imitation Of A Nonexistent Life. And you do it by assembling other people''s art, an imitation of a nonexistent deer and imitations of nonexistent trees. You use perspective to create an illusion of depth, but your background only conveys snowfall, it doesn''t convey ground and sky, so the objects float in a sentimental nothingness. This is the Magic of which you speak: no meaning, no themes, no insights into the human condition, just the Magic for its own sake, just an assertion of the power of human imagination.', '2019-01-21 11:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609571, 1230910, 50695, '<td valign="top">if you copied that mouse and put it all over everything, you''re a genius. Oh wait, I can tell from the shadows it was you. You''re a genius. Crazy, but a genius.</td>', 'if you copied that mouse and put it all over everything, you''re a genius. Oh wait, I can tell from the shadows it was you. You''re a genius. Crazy, but a genius.', '2019-01-21 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609572, 1230843, 50695, '<td valign="top">sometimes I feel like all my art is just a strange, pointless parody of art.</td>', 'sometimes I feel like all my art is just a strange, pointless parody of art.', '2019-01-21 11:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609573, 1231045, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is so photographic. the huddled figure walking toward us, the eyes covered in shadow. there''s something so photographic about the way shadows clump together to make forms. Somehow by creatively combining two exposures you just emphasize that more. This is like a dollar bill backed by the bank of old feelings.</td>', 'this is so photographic. the huddled figure walking toward us, the eyes covered in shadow. there''s something so photographic about the way shadows clump together to make forms. Somehow by creatively combining two exposures you just emphasize that more. This is like a dollar bill backed by the bank of old feelings.', '2019-01-21 11:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609575, 1230649, 50695, '<td valign="top">What a strange vacuous creepiness. It''s like I''m looking at a photo of my grandmother and then she suddenly fades out of the photo, leaving only an empty place that I will never be able to find. Further research reveals it was a frame from an old movie that my grandmother saw as a child but didn''t remember until after she died. She was in the middle of replacing the actors with herself when the photo was taken. I hope she succeeded.</td>', 'What a strange vacuous creepiness. It''s like I''m looking at a photo of my grandmother and then she suddenly fades out of the photo, leaving only an empty place that I will never be able to find. Further research reveals it was a frame from an old movie that my grandmother saw as a child but didn''t remember until after she died. She was in the middle of replacing the actors with herself when the photo was taken. I hope she succeeded.', '2019-01-21 11:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609577, 1230890, 50695, '<td valign="top">I can''t read music, but this photo benefits from a soundtrack. <br/> <br/>Maybe this is why waterfall photos always seem like only half a photo to me.</td>', 'I can''t read music, but this photo benefits from a soundtrack.  Maybe this is why waterfall photos always seem like only half a photo to me.', '2019-01-21 11:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609579, 1231030, 50695, '<td valign="top">others have tried the old "slap some blurry distorting effects on a boring photo" trick, but you do it well. The railroad tracks are utterly savage in a Modernist sort of way, while the sky is Van Gogh painting in water colors and then ruining it with his tears. All in all, it''s a photo of Yeats''s cold eye cast on this life, this death.</td>', 'others have tried the old "slap some blurry distorting effects on a boring photo" trick, but you do it well. The railroad tracks are utterly savage in a Modernist sort of way, while the sky is Van Gogh painting in water colors and then ruining it with his tears. All in all, it''s a photo of Yeats''s cold eye cast on this life, this death.', '2019-01-21 11:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609580, 1230692, 50695, '<td valign="top">there is an art to simplicity, if you can get it cold enough. I find this drink very refreshing.</td>', 'there is an art to simplicity, if you can get it cold enough. I find this drink very refreshing.', '2019-01-21 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609581, 1230610, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how he''s yin yanging with the cat. and those all too human eyes</td>', 'I love how he''s yin yanging with the cat. and those all too human eyes', '2019-01-21 11:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609582, 1231028, 50695, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m not the intended audience, but I do like the flatness achieved b lining up the top of the fence with the edge of the field, and I like the yellow light which seems to represent aging, and I like how the worn out barn makes the whole field looks worn out, but in a way that shows wear and tear as its own branching, spreading beauty.</td>', 'I feel like I''m not the intended audience, but I do like the flatness achieved b lining up the top of the fence with the edge of the field, and I like the yellow light which seems to represent aging, and I like how the worn out barn makes the whole field looks worn out, but in a way that shows wear and tear as its own branching, spreading beauty.', '2019-01-21 11:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609583, 1231027, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like this more than I should. Sometimes gimmicks work as art, if you do it with the right kind of authority and weirdness. I think it''s because the dogs are looking so pointedly in different directions, and also the rich dark background, as if the dog holder is a night sky with arms.</td>', 'I like this more than I should. Sometimes gimmicks work as art, if you do it with the right kind of authority and weirdness. I think it''s because the dogs are looking so pointedly in different directions, and also the rich dark background, as if the dog holder is a night sky with arms.', '2019-01-21 11:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7609584, 1230854, 50695, '<td valign="top">the centered crow surrounded by various kinds of lines complexly crossing is a good start. plus, I like crows. They seem to be telling me something.</td>', 'the centered crow surrounded by various kinds of lines complexly crossing is a good start. plus, I like crows. They seem to be telling me something.', '2019-01-21 11:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
