(7609738, 1230363, 124815, '<td valign="top">This dog understands the world a lot better now that shes deaf. And an old soul in spite of her joyful nature. <br/>A Buddhist would say that you were wrong to form such an attachment but thats a week thought. Love is everything. The only enduring thing.<br/>Both photographs are amazing. <br/>For once we all agreed here with the blue.</td>', 'This dog understands the world a lot better now that shes deaf. And an old soul in spite of her joyful nature. A Buddhist would say that you were wrong to form such an attachment but thats a week thought. Love is everything. The only enduring thing.Both photographs are amazing. For once we all agreed here with the blue.', '2019-01-22 00:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
